ップでお願いします。\n\n【ポーズ】\n左手（スマートウォッチをつけている手）をピースサインで描いていただくと幸いです\n\nその他追加指定はございません。\nゆうゆう様が可愛く描いていただける範囲でお願いします。\n\n差支えなければTwitterやNote（クリエイター用ブログ）等での掲載を検討させていただきたく存じます。\nその際はゆうゆう様のクレジットを明記させていただきます。\n\nご検討いただけますと幸甚に存じます。\n宜しくお願いします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1303, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "武侍", "screen_name": "takezamurai", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1965119675362410503/gEaHuwKK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/68666440/1551150026/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 8434, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "お茶(薄め)", "screen_name": "greenvodka02", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1759880162643181568/PLEojLhG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/980088027698511873/1708423103/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 122727, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "かぼす", "screen_name": "kabosudachin", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1995089419813236736/MdOfIoWZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1708804310065389568/1696248056/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "com